WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Perfect Cheesecake. 480 min · 12 servings · American

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ingredients: 9. 1 3/4 cups graham cracker crumbs (about 15 full crackers); 1/3 cup butter, melted; 1/4 cup granulated sugar; 1/2 teaspoon kosher salt

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Section: Crust

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Step 1. Preheat oven to 350°F.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 2. Mix the graham cracker crumbs, butter, granulated sugar, and salt together evenly.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Step 3. Press the mixture into the bottom and up the sides of a 9-inch springform pan.

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Step 4. Bake the crust for 8–10 minutes, or until lightly golden. Set aside while you make the cheesecake.

8
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Section: Cheesecake

9
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Step 5. In the bowl of a stand mixer fitted with the paddle attachment, mix the cream cheese and sugar on medium speed until smooth, scraping the sides of th…

10
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Step 6. Turn the mixer to low and add the sour cream and vanilla; mix well, scraping sides of the bowl as necessary.

11
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Step 7. Add the eggs, 1 at a time, mixing on low speed after each addition just until mixed. Don’t overmix.

12
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Step 8. Pour the filling over the crust and spread evenly.

13
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Step 9. Double wrap the bottom of the springform pan with foil, sealing it tightly to prevent water from getting into the pan.

14
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
